# Mobile Fahrer-Navigation: Routing & NavigationEngine

## Laufzeit-Diagnose (`[NavDiag]`)

Metro/Xcode/Logcat nach Tag **`[NavDiag]`** filtern. Datei: `artifacts/mobile/utils/navRuntimeDiag.ts`.

| Log | Bedeutung |
|-----|-----------|
| `pipeline_owners` | Wer berechnet Heading/Pitch/Zoom/Reroute (einmal pro Ride/Phase) |
| `gps_watch_mount` / `unmount` | GPS-Listener in `navigation.tsx` (Doppel-Mount = Effect neu) |
| `gps_tick` | `tickNavEngine: true/false`, raw vs display (snap), `forwardDistM`, `headingDeltaDeg`, `progressM`, `confirmedOffRoute` |
| `camera` | `setCamera` / `animateCamera` / `skipped` / `error` + caller |
| `reroute_decision` | Wird Server-Reroute gestartet? Warum blockiert? |
| `reroute_request_start` / `done` | HTTP-Reroute + `elapsedMs` |

**Crash-Guards:** `tickNavEngine` in try/catch; Kamera nur bei finiten Args; `setCamera`/`animateCamera` try/catch (sonst nativer Map-Crash).

## Zielarchitektur (inkrementell)

GPS → PositionFilter → MapMatcher → HeadingEngine → RouteProgress → RerouteEngine → ManeuverEngine → EtaEngine → CameraController → UI.

- **Tick:** `artifacts/mobile/utils/navEngine/` — `tickNavEngine`
- **Screen:** `navigation.tsx` — UI + Side-Effects
- **Legacy parallel:** `applyDriverNavFix` noch in `focusNavigationCamera` (heading null) + Recenter — in `pipeline_owners` geloggt

## Quelle / Off-Route / Kamera

Siehe vorherige Abschnitte (Matrix+OSRM, Forward-Distanz, Pitch 62°, Speed-Zoom). Smoke: `navEngine.selftest.ts`, `navOffRouteReroute.selftest.ts`.
